                <pb facs="0362" n="290" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg290"/>

                <head>No. 138.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lowell to Mr. Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>O’Mahoney was discharged 4th of August. Case of Brophy is being considered. Have
                    heard nothing from Secretary of Ireland concerning cases of Meany or George.</p>
                <closer><signed>LOWELL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
